# Tokyo Wars master DSP: every program address the interpreter ORACLE executed (tools/c25oracle,
# C71_COV; TW_C25=oracle, the tw_oracle build), with the program it belongs to (bios, or the 68K ROM
# address of the block's count word). ADDRESSES ONLY. The BIOS lines below start as the union of Prop
# Cycle's and Rave Racer's (c71.bin is the same file); the game block's come from Tokyo Wars' own runs.
# 2026-10-05: + the TEST-MODE master programs (the 68K's table at ROM 0x125250, 12 entries, and 0x12C070 uploaded by 0x124C52): coverage from
#   18 interpreter test-mode key walks (work/twdsp), and Time Crisis's coverage for the 7 blocks whose words are identical to its own
